{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_bronze_scale","model_identifier":"armour_bronze_scale","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_bronze_scale\n\nArmour set, bronze scale.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -12.2..12.2, y 20.0..51.2, z -6.0..6.0 (size 24.5 x 31.2 x 12.0 u = 69 x 88 x 34 cm).\nBronze scale: a scale shirt (staggered overlapping-scale pixel pattern, leather collar, on `torso`, inflate 1.0), a scale skirt of four panels to mid-thigh (on `hips`, inflate 1.0), and short upper sleeves on `arm_upper_r/l` (inflate 1.25 so they overlap the shirt at the shoulder). No bronze plate exists, per the brief. Same bones/pivots as warrior_base. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n"},"description":"## armour_bronze_scale\n\nArmour set, bronze scale.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -12.2..12.2, y 20.0..51.2, z -6.0..6.0 (size 24.5 x 31.2 x 12.0 u = 69 x 88 x 34 cm).\nBronze scale: a scale shirt (staggered overlapping-scale pixel pattern, leather collar, on `torso`, inflate 1.0), a scale skirt of four panels to mid-thigh (on `hips`, inflate 1.0), and short upper sleeves on `arm_upper_r/l` (inflate 1.25 so they overlap the shirt at the shoulder). No bronze plate exists, per the brief. Same bones/pivots as warrior_base. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"scale_shirt","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,34.0,-4.0],"to":[7.0,50.0,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.0,"origin":[0.0,33.0,0.0],"fa